29. WHAT ARE BIND VARIABLES?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    Reuse SQL execution plan.

Example:

    SELECT *
    FROM Employee
    WHERE EmpId = :id;

Benefits:

    • Faster Execution
    • Less Parsing
    • Reduced Memory Usage

